  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackling Serious Organized Crime (TSOC) Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The embassy will support accountability and transparency initiatives that  improve and sustain democratic gains especially  anti-corruption initailly by collaborating with FCDO. Tackling Serious Organized Crime (TSOC) aims to strengthen the anti-corruption environment and increase the likelihood and severity of sanctions for serious and organised corruption and related crimes in Malawi.  The Norwegian support will focus on building capacity in the procedures and practoicalities for anti-corruption partner agencies to manage, value and dispose of seized assets; and also support Malawians themselves though ciivil society to hold corruption to account</narrative>
  </description>
